# Runtime data
data/
**/.pux/
.deepagents/

# Org runtime data (5G+ of model weights, venvs, parsed dumps, memos).
# Org *templates* ship as AGENTS.md + agents/<slug>.md + skills/ + sandbox/ —
# those ARE source. Use orgs/* (not orgs/) so per-org negations can win, then
# exclude everything inside each org except the source files re-negated below.
# General is the sole top-level org; all other orgs live under specialists/.
orgs/*
!orgs/general/
# _shared is not an org (no AGENTS.md/CTO overlay; discover_orgs skips it) but
# holds cross-org SOURCE: agents/ (e.g. researcher) + skills/ + sandbox/ +
# clients/. Must un-ignore the parent or git won't descend into it.
!orgs/_shared/
# Specialists subfolder — nested orgs live here.
!orgs/specialists/
# Ignore everything at depth 2 inside top-level orgs (general, _shared).
orgs/*/*
# Un-ignore org directories inside specialists/ so git can descend into them.
# (They were caught by orgs/*/* above.)
!orgs/specialists/*/
# Re-include source files/dirs at depth 2 for top-level orgs.
!orgs/*/AGENTS.md
!orgs/*/policy.yaml
!orgs/*/org.yaml
!orgs/*/profile.yaml
!orgs/*/tool_servers.yaml
!orgs/*/skills/
!orgs/*/sandbox/
!orgs/*/agents/
!orgs/*/upstream_skills/
# Ignore everything at depth 3 inside specialists/<org>/ (runtime data
# directories, build outputs, etc.).
orgs/specialists/*/*
# Re-include source files/dirs at depth 3 for nested orgs.
!orgs/specialists/*/AGENTS.md
!orgs/specialists/*/policy.yaml
!orgs/specialists/*/org.yaml
!orgs/specialists/*/profile.yaml
!orgs/specialists/*/Dockerfile
!orgs/specialists/*/skills/
!orgs/specialists/*/sandbox/
!orgs/specialists/*/scripts/
!orgs/specialists/*/agents/

# Org-scoped runtime artifacts (article bodies, backtest outputs, parsed
# chat dumps, memos, etc.) — written by the agent during runs, not source.
artifacts/
**/artifacts/
**/workspace/
**/memos/
**/telegram_parsed.json
**/walkthrough_progress.json
**/INVEST-TRACKER.md

# Test artifacts
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Reference repos (cloned, not tracked)
reference/

# Sandbox / projects
projects/

# Browser-test cruft (one-off artifacts from Selenium/xdotool runs)
downloaded_files/
form.html

# Orphan venvs (root .venv/ is covered above; this catches siblings)
.venv-*/

# External research notes (system cards, design docs from outside the repo)
INSIGHTS-*.md

# Subagent default-output pollution — pi-subagents writes to project root
# when an agent's `output:` frontmatter is a bare filename. Operators should
# give explicit paths in task strings; this catches the leaks.
/brief.md
/draft.md
/manifest.md
/options.md
/research.md
/script.md
/test-report.md
/video-productions/

# Internal planning docs
GAPS-*.md

